/*
 * Declares the AwaitValue class.
 *
 * AwaitValue represents an `await` of an async body: it suspends the body until
 * the value it awaits is ready, or, without a value, gives control back to the
 * driver of the async.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::scope::await_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/scope/await_.yr
 * @Author(s):
